    "body": "## What and why\n\n#2117 formed28 distinct legal updates without a protected proposal. This saved-evidence attribution distinguishes recurring destinations, changing protected conflicts and signed Prefix/Generate compensation before selecting another construction mechanism. It adds a reproducible analyzer and retained diagnosis, with no model/runtime change or new candidate search.\n\n## Result\n\nExact #2117 attempt3 (`3bbcc792…` report / `f616174c…` manifest), original development input245 conditional episode/17reference roles/380protected rows: all32 saved rounds and28unique destinations authenticate exactly. Violated-row union338/380, intersection0 for both populations; most frequent guard24/28unique. Round0 changes11Prefix/0Generate; round31 changes32Prefix/11Generate with28/52 violated rows having opposing nonzero family signs. Positive original-pair linearized margins remain diagnostics, not native retention evidence. No cycle or global infeasibility claim.\n\n**KEEP** saved diagnosis; previous candidate **REJECTED**, direct joint legal-set construction **NOT YET PROMOTED**. Accepted8/512 development complete replies and separate conditional9/15 artifact unchanged. Next is a bounded generic constrained-formation specification under the same protection/descent and native gates, not feedback-parameter tuning.\n\n## Validation and retention\n\nHead `6de4d9832a5280eda019be596b9479e4b9dbf79e`: analyzer self-tests, claim wording and diff checks PASS. Single actual attribution at unchanged analyzer SHA86c219bc… took30.366s/88,047,616bytes RSS, zero model/native-score/gradient/solver calls. Source/output normative seal verification PASS. Small unchanged report helper builds offline12.87s and its two existing exclusivity/seal tests PASS. No changed model Rust path requires a model compile/run. Independent saved-result arithmetic and mathematics reviews are committed; exact-head review is posted before queueing.\n\nNew results verified via cloud-store upload/download at `icloud:UOR-R4/results/codex/codex-discrete-feedback-attribution-20261009.tar`,31,706,112bytes,MD5`3588f378275c1ea35b9e72d6ae1ba008`. Original624MB input remains separately verified; no new paid compute. Full preparation/delivery/cleanup cost continues shared cumulative ledger; admission25min,2threads,1GiB analysisRAM,3GiB transient,50MiB reports,30GiB floor.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Checks run at this exact head (above; exact-head review posted before queue)\n- [x] Dated research record with artifacts, data/config, numbers, decisions and limits\n- [x] New current-state entry with **Next:**\n- [x] Stale-doc search completed; original experiment links completed follow-through\n- [x] STATUS / ROADMAP / #2028 unchanged: accepted artifacts and milestone unchanged\n- [x] README unchanged: no capability/headline/command/mechanism change\n- [x] Geometry roles/facts unchanged; no diagram regeneration required\n- [x] Claim-wording check PASS\n- [x] After merge: fresh-main source verification, remote/local branch and worktree deletion, hygiene and M2 result comment\n\nReferences #2030\n\n## Delivery receipt\n\nMerged3393d70c874b5c24bb1943ed1eeae46e224f79e5; fresh-main ancestry and all7 source blobs verified. Remote/local branch and owned worktree deleted; verified-restorable local material removed, hygiene applied with peer data preserved, Casey checkout clean main. Complete charged elapsed16.708min through2026-10-10T01:24:55.251810+00:00 (preparation, restoration, analysis, review, merge and cleanup), not model training time. Shared cumulative1456254279ms / limit1458000028ms. No GPU/paid compute. Free space37.92GiB; hygiene had no additional eligible large items, uv cache prune skipped busy. Late delivery receipts retained under local ledger; substantive source/evidence main+iCloud.\n",
